# Normain System Description

**Proposed final draft.** This artifact is the current Google Doc draft with all code-review edits and owner decisions applied. The Google Doc has **not** been modified; copy this across only on the owner's instruction.

SOC 2 Type 2 examination period: **4 May 2026 – 4 August 2026**. Auditor: Prescient Assurance LLC. Trust Services Category: Security only.

